# __EDGE_SMTP_BIND__ is "0.0.0.0:25" when the edge is live, else "127.0.0.1:25".
# On the real host, dormant (loopback) is the default: it is one configuration
# change from live and accepts no Internet mail until it is made. The rehearsal
# binds 0.0.0.0:25 inside an isolated compose network — reachable only by the
# test sender and never published to the host (asserted by the socket check).
#
